    <div class="section-title" style="background-color: #b91c1c;">第二部份與高階挑戰題：填充題標準答案與深度解析</div>
    <div class="question-block">
        <p><strong>13. 39996</strong> [cite: 32] (解析：(200-2)(200+2) = 40000 - 4 = 39996 [cite: 32])</p>
        <p><strong>14. 20</strong> [cite: 37] (解析：a<sup>2</sup>+b<sup>2</sup> = 6<sup>2</sup> - 2(4) = 28 [cite: 36]；(a-b)<sup>2</sup> = 28 - 2(4) = 20 [cite: 37])</p>
        <p><strong>15. 14x<sup>2</sup> - 21x + 13</strong> [cite: 58] (解析：(8x<sup>2</sup>-6x+10) - (-6x<sup>2</sup>+15x-3) = 14x<sup>2</sup> - 21x + 13 [cite: 54, 55, 56, 58])</p>
        <p><strong>16. 70~80</strong> [cite: 81] (解析：累積到19人之後 [cite: 79]，第20、21名全落在70~80組別內 [cite: 80, 81])</p>
        <p><strong>17. 35</strong> [cite: 103] (解析：60% - 25% = 35% [cite: 103])</p>
        <p><strong>18. 35</strong> [cite: 104] (解析：100人 &times; 35% = 35人 [cite: 104])</p>
        <p><strong>19. 65</strong> [cite: 66] (解析：(60+70) &divide; 2 = 65 [cite: 66])</p>
        <p><strong>20. 眾數</strong> [cite: 68] (出現頻率最高之集中趨勢指標 [cite: 68])</p>
        <p><strong>21. 40</strong> [cite: 89] (累積次數折線圖起點必連至第一組之下限 [cite: 89])</p>
        <p><strong>22. 23</strong> [cite: 15] (解析：(x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> - 2 = 25 - 2 = 23 [cite: 15])</p>
