        <div style="border: 1px solid #b91c1c; padding: 8px; margin-top: 10px; background-color: #fdf2f2;">
            <p><strong style="color: #b91c1c;">25.【高階挑戰題一解答】 14</strong> [cite: 15]<br/>
            <strong>深度解析：</strong> 利用三項和的平方擴展公式：<span class="math-expr">(a + b + c)<sup>2</sup> = a<sup>2</sup> + b<sup>2</sup> + c<sup>2</sup> + 2(ab + bc + ca)</span> [cite: 15]。<br/>
            將已知數據代入公式中：<span class="math-expr">7<sup>2</sup> = 21 + 2(ab + bc + ca)</span> &rArr; <span class="math-expr">49 = 21 + 2(ab + bc + ca)</span>。<br/>
            移項得：<span class="math-expr">2(ab + bc + ca) = 28</span> &rArr; <span class="math-expr">ab + bc + ca = 14</span>。</p>
            
            <p><strong style="color: #b91c1c;">26.【高階挑戰題二解答】 194</strong> [cite: 15]<br/>
            <strong>深度解析：</strong> 將已知同除以 <span class="math-expr">x</span>：<span class="math-expr">x<sup>2</sup> - 4x + 1 = 0 &rArr; x - 4 + 1/x = 0 &rArr; x + 1/x = 4</span>。<br/>
            進行第一次平方 [cite: 15]：<span class="math-expr">(x + 1/x)<sup>2</sup> = 4<sup>2</sup> &rArr; x<sup>2</sup> + 2 + 1/x<sup>2</sup> = 16 &rArr; x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup> = 14</span>。<br/>
            進行第二次平方 [cite: 15]：<span class="math-expr">(x<sup>2</sup> + 1/x<sup>2</sup>)<sup>2</sup> = 14<sup>2</sup> &rArr; x<sup>4</sup> + 2 + 1/x<sup>4</sup> = 196 &rArr; x<sup>4</sup> + 1/x<sup>4</sup> = 194</span>。</p>
            
            <p><strong style="color: #b91c1c;">27.【高階挑戰題三解答】 -101</strong> [cite: 25]<br/>
            <strong>深度解析：</strong> 利用平方差公式拆解分子中的每一項 [cite: 25]：<br/>
            <span class="math-expr">1<sup>2</sup> - 2<sup>2</sup> = (1 - 2)(1 + 2) = -1 &times; 3</span> [cite: 25]<br/>
            <span class="math-expr">3<sup>2</sup> - 4<sup>2</sup> = (3 - 4)(3 + 4) = -1 &times; 7</span> [cite: 25]<br/>
            每一項都有共同因數 <span class="math-expr">-1</span>，故分子可提出 <span class="math-expr">-1</span> 變為：<span class="math-expr">-1 &times; [ (1+2) + (3+4) + (5+6) + ... + (99+100) ]</span>。<br/>
            括號內即為 <span class="math-expr">1</span> 加到 <span class="math-expr">100</span> 的總和，公式為：<span class="math-expr">(1 + 100) &times; 100 / 2 = 5050</span>。<br/>
            因此分子總和為 <span class="math-expr">-5050</span>。將其除以分母 50：<span class="math-expr">-5050 / 50 = -101</span>。</p>
